      },
      "alignment": "tn",
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>A steel greyhound frame wrapped in synthetic hedge, its jaws studded with cold-iron thorns. Hounds lie dormant in the hedges until the Gardener whistles.</p>"
      },
      "notes": {
        "value": "<div class=\"hg-journal\"><h3>Printed stat block</h3><section class=\"hg-statblock\"><h4 class=\"hg-sb-title\">TOPIARY HOUND — CR 8</h4><p><strong>XP</strong> 4,800 · N Medium construct (robot)</p><p><strong>Init</strong> +6; <strong>Senses</strong> darkvision 60 ft., low-light vision, scent; Perception +19</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">DEFENSE</h5><p><strong>AC</strong> 21, touch 12, flat-footed 19 (+2 Dex, +9 natural)</p><p><strong>hp</strong> 86 (12d10+20)</p><p><strong>Fort</strong> +4, <strong>Ref</strong> +6, <strong>Will</strong> +5</p><p><strong>Immune</strong> construct traits; <strong>Weaknesses</strong> vulnerable to critical hits, vulnerable to electricity</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">OFFENSE</h5><p><strong>Speed</strong> 50 ft.</p><p><strong>Melee</strong> bite +17 (2d8+7 plus cold-iron thorns and trip)</p><p><strong>Special Attacks</strong> pack pounce, pollen burst</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">STATISTICS</h5><p><strong>Str</strong> 20, <strong>Dex</strong> 14, <strong>Con</strong> —, <strong>Int</strong> 10, <strong>Wis</strong> 12, <strong>Cha</strong> 1</p><p><strong>Base Atk</strong> +12; <strong>CMB</strong> +17; <strong>CMD</strong> 29 (33 vs. trip)</p><p><strong>Feats</strong> Improved Initiative, Lunge, Power Attack, Run, Skill Focus (Perception), Stealthy</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Perception +19, Stealth +16 (+24 in vegetation); <strong>Racial Modifiers</strong> +8 Stealth in vegetation</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">SPECIAL ABILITIES</h5><p><strong>Cold-Iron Thorns (Ex)</strong> The hound’s bite counts as cold iron. A fey it bites also takes 1d6 bleed damage.</p><p><strong>Pack Pounce (Ex)</strong> A hound gains a +2 bonus on attack rolls against a creature another hound threatens. This stacks with flanking.</p><p><strong>Pollen Burst (Ex)</strong> When destroyed, a hound bursts into a 10-foot-radius cloud of Mood Gas (Fortitude DC 18, Will DC 18).</p></section></div>"
      }
