      "name": "Stealthy",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<i>You are good at avoiding unwanted attention and slipping out of bonds.</i><p><strong>Benefits</strong>: You get a +2 bonus on all Escape Artist and Stealth skill checks. If you have 10 or more ranks in one of these skills, the bonus increases to +4 for that skill.</p>"
        },
